      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "犹豫，以及没有对上的视线\n正是高尚骏逸内心纠葛的表现吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5b1d8203880fd7dfe6c3f6835fd30b33dcaf470f0c64e78a9bd0e371173f5b0",
