      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽说如此，在新马级，\n并没有举办高尚骏逸最适应的\n长距离比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "59859d1b9b17b3f39d49ea8879924f900bfc24310cd14899e6892599cb8b2b83",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
